      "entries": [
        "The mummy creates a temporary sandstorm in a 30-foot emanation that lasts for 1 minute. Creatures within the emanation take a –4 circumstance penalty to Perception checks and must succeed at a DC 33 Fortitude save or be forced to hold their breath or start suffocating (Core Rulebook 478). A creature within the sandstorm at the end of its turn takes 2d6 negative and 1d6 slashing damage."
